  "verification": "Unity Mac and WebGL builds with zero errors and warnings and all editor suites; 64 browser assertions across desktop and phone viewports covering the start-screen link and dialog, the cover and pause routes, chapter seek, play/pause, Close/Escape, 44-point targets and text fit; native review captures of every screen at 1280x720 and 844x390. Physical iPhone playback remains pending. Public history contains the compiled release and release metadata only.",
